   Epping, Amanda J.; Taglialatela, Jared P., Ape Cognit \& Conservat Initiat, Des Moines, IA USA.
   Taglialatela, Jared P., Kennesaw State Univ, Dept Ecol Evolut \& Organismal Biol, Kennesaw, GA USA.
   Townsend, Simon W., Univ Warwick, Dept Psychol, Warwick, England.},
